### Fee transaction API samples
@host = https://localhost:5001
@owner = 0c250000-50bf-11e7-89e2-1cbdb9e7fd04

### Create transaction
POST {{host}}/api/fee/transactions
X-Owner-Id: {{owner}}
X-User-Id: tester
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "txNo": "TX-001",
  "txDate": "2026-10-26T10:00:00Z",
  "studentId": "stu-001",
  "paymentMode": "Cash",
  "isOpeningBalanceAdjusted": false,
  "refNo": "REF-001",
  "receivedInAccount": "Cash",
  "paidBy": "Parent",
  "installmentsPaid": [
    { "feeId": "FEE_GUID", "no": 1, "amount": 5000 }
  ],
  "finesPaid": [],
  "discounts": [],
  "adjustments": []
}

### List transactions for student
GET {{host}}/api/fee/transactions?studentId=stu-001
X-Owner-Id: {{owner}}

### Fees to be paid
GET {{host}}/api/fee/transactions/feesToBePaid?studentId=stu-001
X-Owner-Id: {{owner}}
